    - target: {fileID: 3237212977458917729, guid: 31af10f8cd475f74792a8903c0ed6f07, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Where.. I don''t remember stopping for the night.

        Son?


        Didn''t
        his mother teach him not to run off like this? He must be old enough to realise
        by now.


        Guess I''ll have to teach him some things now that he''s
        finally agreed to see me again. But first I need to get out of this room.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
