--- !u!1001 &2109080489
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 2371527867909937182}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 4613828026226185999, guid: 3b2842f6aeffbd24cac0d9e63051d100, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: '7th October 1969


        All this tinkering isn''t helping my progress.
        Perhaps I do deserve some rest once in a while. But then again, there are
        more important things.


        But really, who knew connecting those old
        mechanisms to a chessboard could be so easy. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
